    "This preview runs in a cloud simulator that isn't on your home Wi-Fi, so it can't see your Roku device. Install GuideStreamTV on your iPhone via the Rork app and open Play on TV there." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This preview runs in a cloud simulator that isn't on your home Wi-Fi, so it can't see your Roku device. Install GuideStreamTV on your iPhone via the Rork app and open Play on TV there."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta vista previa corre en un simulador en la nube que no está en tu Wi-Fi, así que no puede ver tu Roku. Instala GuideStreamTV en tu iPhone desde la app de Rork y abre Reproducir en TV ahí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This script creates every missing table, adds any missing columns, and installs the row-level-security policies the app needs. Safe to re-run." : {
